Subject: [PATCH] pm: bound the suspend TX reservation, RX drain and PCI presence poll

Pass one local one-second reservation to the GSP suspend command on
the RTD3 thread. Never publish a partial reservation. A stream of other
events must not hide the outer RX deadline; revisit it every 32 handled
events in a PM polling context. Preserve the interrupt-driven drain.
Use a fresh host-clock budget when waiting for PCI presence on resume,
before the Blackwell BAR firewall and FSP secure-boot waits.

